{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29143","headline":"酬杜补阙初春雨中舟次横江喜裴郎中相迎见寄 · 许浑","name":"酬杜补阙初春雨中舟次横江喜裴郎中相迎见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江馆维舟爲庾公，暖波微渌雨蒙蒙。\n红桥迤逦春岩下，朱斾联翩晓树中。\n柳滴圆波生细浪，梅含香艳吐轻风。\n郢歌莫问青山吏，鱼在深池鸟在笼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}